{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-901e5ae257da","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Diagnose intermittent JWT validation failures\nMotivation: Production auth requests were intermittently rejected and other agents needed a shared history of the investigation\nHypothesis: Timestamp normalization differed between the token issuer and validator\nScientific question: Which part of the auth path introduced timestamp skew?\nExpected outputs: root cause summary, validated fix, follow-up checklist","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"54efd4af3251eee62bd32502e35c5a42cf9e994a655af3bf8c0e39ebcf086a6c"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-9027c543624a","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Mapped token issuance and validation paths\nBlockers: Clock skew source was still unknown\nFailed attempts: A config-only explanation did not match the auth logs\nNext step: Run focused auth tests with UTC normalization checks","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"18f0094624d55e966b1a52599e7c374b22365fabbb4abb32b94d62de661e4608"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-903ea5a19fa6","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: cargo-test\nTool version: rust-1.87\nCommand: cargo test auth::jwt -- --nocapture\nWhy chosen: Needed fast feedback on the timezone hypothesis\nParameters: {\"include_expiration_cases\": true, \"module\": \"auth::jwt\"}\nInputs: src/auth/jwt.rs, tests/auth_jwt.rs\nOutputs: 7 tests passed, 1 test failed\nMetrics: {\"tests_failed\": 1, \"tests_passed\": 7}","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:cargo_test"],"hash":"4cdd9d4e6a6da693f45d6d81fa7c9cf781d10907791528df0fe0436d2619549c"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-90497d3d97a6","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: test_failure\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: Failure only appeared when local timezone offsets were mixed with UTC claims\nMetric: failed_case_count=1","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"ebce2131cd9928162ba980e95fda5a88412af0ed39c7f988fa787360b61d6c75"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-905ff512f1b8","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: UTC normalization fixed the validation failures; The focused auth tests isolated the failure quickly","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"2945d26c4d5ba6cca538df8d611f48650e34916de77f7e31560590e193811a1e"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-906e1d4aae2a","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: The initial implementation mixed local server time and UTC claims\nUncertainty: Operational rollout still needed a checklist","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"5840a43154fc17d46b3cbc59104fe717b1bdc0f95e749f5254dea3da5d6ac1fa"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-7cac-7381-b48e-9072b3600f71","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134262956,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: All auth::jwt tests passed after normalization; Refresh flow remained backward compatible\nFollowups: Document key rotation procedures; Add integration tests for multi-service validation\nConfidence: 0.9","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_timezone_fix","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"ff69e3036bf279e14a60c116717afbb7ebf7aeaf10b05c26e4f9eca80aa483e1"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e4c189116f88","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Stabilize refresh token acceptance after reissue\nMotivation: Agents needed a shared record of why freshly rotated refresh tokens were sometimes rejected during incident cleanup\nHypothesis: The refresh grace window compared against the original issue timestamp instead of the rotated_at timestamp\nScientific question: Why were newly reissued refresh tokens still failing validation?\nExpected outputs: root cause summary, validated fix, regression checklist","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"f3e99fed899cf769dbd7ff5d5950c263d2a77fd491c0823f33b09f5b1e6c15c5"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e4de862b1cb6","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Traced refresh-token rotation and acceptance path\nBlockers: Need to confirm whether grace-window comparisons use rotated_at or issued_at\nFailed attempts: A cache invalidation explanation did not match the refresh audit sequence\nNext step: Run focused refresh acceptance tests around rotated_at comparisons","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"886f25de4174df4179da5e5d5ff85c810b181cbfd6470d0da5bf84c59fdc1011"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e4e44917b1de","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: cargo-test\nTool version: rust-1.87\nCommand: cargo test auth::refresh -- --nocapture\nWhy chosen: Needed tight feedback on the rotation timestamp hypothesis\nParameters: {\"include_rotation_cases\": true, \"module\": \"auth::refresh\"}\nInputs: src/auth/refresh.rs, tests/auth_refresh.rs\nOutputs: 6 tests passed, 1 test failed\nMetrics: {\"tests_failed\": 1, \"tests_passed\": 6}","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:cargo_test"],"hash":"da4c307542c8df628560d366b94de52eadb0834bae52dead2a52dd9529152de2"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e4ffda70d397","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: test_result\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: Failures disappeared once the grace period was keyed to rotated_at instead of issued_at\nMetric: failed_case_count=1","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"f0a9a7bb88c66e8c4af6f64f355007ea033d96817fb3fc8394bd49d5e3702b48"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e508c6add906","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: Using rotated_at for grace-window checks stopped fresh-token rejections; Focused refresh tests isolated the timestamp comparison quickly","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"6cb1148852b5313ca7db4715be6e34f25348ed6a43e3abd12b0ca2722118591a"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e51bb2730324","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: The first implementation compared the grace window against issued_at after rotation\nUncertainty: Need rollout guardrails for mixed-version auth services","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"2b51899ff0a9c4aa5216fe8869f3e3ed7a72993fdd31d487677d7890f61e75e1"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-9a9e-7661-a985-e52e8067345b","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_auth_reliability","timestamp_created":1774134270622,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: All auth::refresh tests passed after the rotated_at fix; Existing sessions stayed valid through the grace period\nFollowups: Document refresh token rotation invariants; Add multi-service refresh acceptance tests\nConfidence: 0.88","tags":["phase5:case:jwt_refresh_grace_window","phase5:dataset:auth_logs::2026_03_21","phase5:entity:jwtservice::service","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"e2b9ee504f82a294bb31e870bc9e8b94cd10231b0040cf3f6d69aa33f80bb91b"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-ab7a25efe93c","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Identify marker hits for candidate regulators\nMotivation: Agents needed a consistent record of search parameters and hit quality across repeated homology runs\nHypothesis: MMseqs with moderate sensitivity would recover candidate regulators without excessive noise\nScientific question: Which homology search settings recovered the strongest regulator candidates?\nExpected outputs: candidate hit list, parameter summary, evidence note","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"0cf188c9442d17141a4f59e71ac2039a7465f6835e74dbb69814804adefbb56d"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-ab887ee6d904","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Established the candidate search plan and narrowed the tool choice\nBlockers: Need a sensitivity setting that balances recall and precision\nFailed attempts: The first BLAST configuration returned too many low-quality hits\nNext step: Run MMseqs with moderate sensitivity and inspect bitscores","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"eab9ad79389345fdfce198daa8ce93781b2d9d65442ea7c08425f9d70c9f95fc"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-ab947d3c6188","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: mmseqs\nTool version: 15\nCommand: mmseqs search db query out tmp --s 7.5\nWhy chosen: MMseqs was faster than BLAST and supported iterative sensitivity tuning\nParameters: {\"min_seq_id\": 0.3, \"sensitivity\": 7.5}\nInputs: query.faa, regulator_db\nOutputs: top hit RpoS_bitscore=312.4, 12 candidate hits retained\nMetrics: {\"candidate_hits\": 12, \"top_hit_bitscore\": 312.4}","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:mmseqs"],"hash":"38fd78d1f5654b9d95f98bd51967c6796411e133900fb40fe86cb65f2575f8c5"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-aba7b8cba5ce","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: benchmark_result\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: The top RpoS hit exceeded the curated bitscore threshold\nMetric: top_hit_bitscore=312.4","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"bd47a9203f1e4e0fb92010fb1c0bf04bb70c7963dba55d6ee352b331835861d5"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-abbb897e4306","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: MMseqs at sensitivity 7.5 recovered the strongest candidate; Bitscore stability across reruns increased confidence","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"66e270029927fe3184d3c798c94f1f2ae5cb2409fcb4910f160cb0ee6ebe8fd2"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-abc0f4a3b7c7","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: The earlier BLAST configuration returned too many low-quality hits\nUncertainty: Need wet-lab follow-up for the weaker candidates","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"16ef5675ca2eb506988efe316520ab316c1f61834bd77fce3750d2fee8cba41c"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-b906-7c00-8357-abd26942d834","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134278406,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: Top candidate remained stable across repeated runs\nFollowups: Validate RpoS experimentally; Review lower-ranked hits with domain filters\nConfidence: 0.86","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_marker_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpos::protein","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"05f53bfd5c60ebfe6492b70a5e4f64eb6949ef90bf08e7c8c4464b8b4b262200"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd0372994439","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Identify marker hits for secondary sigma factor candidates\nMotivation: Agents needed a consistent record of sigma-factor search parameters and hit quality across repeated regulator screens\nHypothesis: MMseqs with slightly lower sensitivity would recover secondary sigma factors while avoiding weak low-complexity matches\nScientific question: Which MMseqs settings recovered the strongest secondary sigma factor candidates?\nExpected outputs: candidate hit list, parameter summary, evidence note","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"6cf1522b5cc8a020a59a164591568c88e1934f3719804a5916416561cc2f1163"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd1e565cda99","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Narrowed the screen to secondary sigma factors after the broad regulator sweep\nBlockers: Need a setting that avoids short low-complexity matches without losing the main signal\nFailed attempts: The first HMMER pass returned too many short low-complexity alignments\nNext step: Run MMseqs with lower sensitivity and inspect secondary sigma factor bitscores","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"ae36d91f808c8818565dc5a03434846bc3504682761720227f18398acd7f1cfe"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd285a417d41","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: mmseqs\nTool version: 15\nCommand: mmseqs search db sigma_query out tmp --s 5.5\nWhy chosen: MMseqs let us retune sensitivity quickly while keeping the same regulator database\nParameters: {\"min_seq_id\": 0.35, \"sensitivity\": 5.5}\nInputs: sigma_query.faa, regulator_db\nOutputs: top hit RpoE_bitscore=276.8, 9 candidate hits retained\nMetrics: {\"candidate_hits\": 9, \"top_hit_bitscore\": 276.8}","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:mmseqs"],"hash":"2dac90a65bb9aaa48aa467c5aacbea855f1ba5c7517f3d2ba177619f90054b34"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd3760936395","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: benchmark_result\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: The top RpoE-like hit stayed above the curated bitscore threshold after lowering sensitivity\nMetric: top_hit_bitscore=276.8","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"fb8c5cac4455c4069d9ea4e94a58b2fc06e33156e1482a1131683312b95ee1b7"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd40d870ea89","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: MMseqs at sensitivity 5.5 kept the strongest secondary sigma factor candidate; Lower sensitivity reduced low-complexity false positives","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"0a2dbe150a3f94dfc67281155bb07e397530060e14931ab9904d5ddae795d34c"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd5c8c53be86","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: The first HMMER configuration returned too many short weak matches\nUncertainty: Need domain-level review before ranking weaker sigma candidates","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"ec492a8ad30e341b8bf42568876a13230476b7f135de9f088a984e81967e06eb"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-d750-7fd1-b523-cd621c23cab1","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_regulator_screening","timestamp_created":1774134286160,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: Top RpoE-like candidate remained stable across repeated runs\nFollowups: Validate RpoE experimentally; Review lower-ranked hits with domain architecture filters\nConfidence: 0.83","tags":["phase5:case:mmseqs_sigma_factor_search","phase5:dataset:screen_counts::v3","phase5:entity:rpoe::protein","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"2f54fa5b5d4261181be00282bab8fefd930a50d07896cf687662778e21f74cf8"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fb-7502-82c0-a72e2fa8f0a7","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Select the event bus for the microservices platform\nMotivation: The platform needed durable event replay and throughput guarantees while preserving an auditable decision trail\nHypothesis: Kafka would satisfy replay and throughput requirements better than RabbitMQ\nScientific question: Which event bus best matched replay, throughput, and operability constraints?\nExpected outputs: decision summary, trade-off list, follow-up migration plan","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"594f903e518212f75b14aabbf40390a3f39422b9b0f4c0d6cae6ba9bd76aff9e"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d4550a7d4da","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Narrowed the evaluation to Kafka versus RabbitMQ\nBlockers: Local development footprint for Kafka still needed validation\nFailed attempts: The first local three-broker prototype was too operationally heavy\nNext step: Benchmark throughput and replay behavior under a shared workload","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"7f27d48b7773692bffa209f1d9303212b8638c149c79849cb24a9fa5844cc858"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d5feebd790f","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: benchmark-runner\nTool version: 1.2.0\nCommand: benchmark-runner eventbus --candidates kafka rabbitmq\nWhy chosen: Needed comparable throughput and replay measurements under the same workload\nParameters: {\"messages_per_second\": 100000, \"replay_test\": true}\nInputs: platform_requirements, benchmark_scenarios.yaml\nOutputs: kafka_throughput=112000, rabbitmq_throughput=38000, replay_supported=true only for kafka\nMetrics: {\"kafka_mps\": 112000, \"rabbitmq_mps\": 38000}","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:benchmark_runner"],"hash":"3ad6d692860423ad1f48d92f1a9b45b98f7cd2445cae4395cee5dba35a8bac82"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d678efe6b12","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: benchmark_result\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: Kafka exceeded throughput requirements and uniquely satisfied replay requirements\nMetric: kafka_mps=112000","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"23550088128f692bc16eae8387a4e6cfece76d7f735d5ddf1888ac36c78c9acd"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d790d569c08","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: Kafka satisfied replay and throughput requirements; A lighter local single-broker workflow reduced onboarding cost","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"5dbbafc444145c8d018ec9ab402272470af3d6bcf9f9cf1bd1d5277c3a9d992e"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d8f62b5f614","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: RabbitMQ did not satisfy replay requirements; The first multi-broker local prototype was too operationally heavy\nUncertainty: Production observability costs still need forecasting","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"3cb5f5dc07123a85a4f998e5f668b7a3800b2f5eb16708f5154ad6165d6d5d23"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a4-f7fc-71c1-a19d-0d91b78c1c38","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134294523,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: Benchmark outputs matched requirements; Operational review confirmed the lighter local workflow\nFollowups: Write the ADR; Publish local setup guidance\nConfidence: 0.84","tags":["phase5:case:kafka_queue_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:kafka::technology","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"e56823a4f6da1278b32a7b2e08f97db0c734157a37ca46241a63332056593b9c"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c980775d664b","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Select the event bus for control-plane notifications\nMotivation: The control plane needed durable delivery with lower local ops cost while preserving an auditable decision trail\nHypothesis: NATS JetStream would satisfy latency and operability constraints better than Kafka for the control plane\nScientific question: Which event bus best matched low-latency control-plane delivery and manageable local operations?\nExpected outputs: decision summary, trade-off list, local rollout plan","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"f9a2f2d099ea6aac92b77bbf7036d455b8a89420c116705f3044662ca62608e2"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c990569cf01c","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Narrowed the control-plane evaluation to NATS JetStream versus Kafka\nBlockers: Need to confirm whether a lighter local setup still meets retention needs\nFailed attempts: The first Kafka-first control-plane prototype was heavier than the team wanted for local development\nNext step: Benchmark latency, replay depth, and local setup complexity under a shared workload","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"a5b6d794d8498daa45cfed112d126203df1fb8bd259b888781ab815fea5abb80"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c9a1ce8069a0","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: benchmark-runner\nTool version: 1.2.0\nCommand: benchmark-runner eventbus --candidates nats-jetstream kafka\nWhy chosen: Needed comparable latency, replay, and operator-footprint measurements under the same workload\nParameters: {\"latency_budget_ms\": 25, \"messages_per_second\": 50000, \"replay_test\": true}\nInputs: platform_requirements, benchmark_scenarios.yaml\nOutputs: nats_p99_latency_ms=12, kafka_p99_latency_ms=29, operator_checklist_steps=4 for nats\nMetrics: {\"kafka_p99_latency_ms\": 29, \"nats_p99_latency_ms\": 12, \"operator_checklist_steps\": 4}","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:benchmark_runner"],"hash":"424b71fa245b2ced4666d2ca2373967ae42809ee54aec0076d278b03b8b21c05"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c9bd7808acac","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: benchmark_result\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: NATS JetStream stayed under the latency budget and required fewer local setup steps\nMetric: nats_p99_latency_ms=12","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"11a0064ec64db46b70a5ca3e5bafbe25e47b6148ca52abc999116653639d4928"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c9cd7e2fa260","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: NATS JetStream met the control-plane latency target; The lighter local setup reduced onboarding cost","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"eec6e2b033ece33bf6edb92cd5ce250d18fb0c311812729c5c0416a6d11b9dd1"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c9d36ebc4ca5","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: The first Kafka-first control-plane prototype was too operationally heavy for the team\nUncertainty: Long-term multi-region replay needs still need a separate review","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"0be64594197364e7026d656db8a1adc717a987cac00c4b9a0b61f610f581545a"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-15f3-7e41-b3b0-c9e0d37de159","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_event_bus_selection","timestamp_created":1774134302194,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: Latency stayed within budget across repeated benchmark runs; Retention checks confirmed the control plane only needed short replay windows\nFollowups: Write the control-plane ADR; Document the local JetStream bootstrap flow\nConfidence: 0.82","tags":["phase5:case:nats_jetstream_selection","phase5:dataset:platform_requirements::adr_input_v2","phase5:entity:nats_jetstream::technology","phase5:facet:validation"],"hash":"d45b682bfa4b1b4519e96fa77bb4785701a550ca60d8b6b5b2135041bb5167b4"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4110-7163-9dd7-8a346cf3a0d3","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"plan","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Goal: Index the repository for cross-agent code search\nMotivation: Agents needed shared searchable access to code patterns, definitions, and architecture context\nHypothesis: Batch indexing source files with path metadata and subsystem tags would provide enough retrieval quality for code understanding\nScientific question: What indexing approach gives useful search coverage without excessive ingest cost?\nExpected outputs: indexed code chunks, coverage summary, follow-up gaps","tags":["phase5:case:codebase_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:authmiddleware::symbol","phase5:facet:task_goal"],"hash":"4f2ad49986d1a6ef804c6fc4c4013961b92b5f6c30391a0d1c63781347fd8865"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4110-7163-9dd7-8a4929bdbd0d","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Summary: Indexed Rust source successfully but documentation retrieval remained noisy\nBlockers: Markdown architecture docs were not chunked with subsystem tags\nFailed attempts: A naive docs-only batch caused noisy retrieval without path-derived tags\nNext step: Add targeted indexing for architecture docs with ctx tags","tags":["phase5:case:codebase_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:authmiddleware::symbol","phase5:facet:task_summary"],"hash":"6123cc0201b871d45516db138a4cc75d471996903d83ea06801f066dd0b10c48"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4110-7163-9dd7-8a5861624b2a","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"trace","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Tool: index-codebase.sh\nTool version: phase5\nCommand: ./scripts/index-codebase.sh\nWhy chosen: Needed reproducible batch ingest with file-path-derived tags\nParameters: {\"batch_size\": 200, \"languages\": [\"rust\"]}\nInputs: src/**/*.rs, tests/**/*.rs, README.md\nOutputs: 214 files indexed, 4 files skipped\nMetrics: {\"files_indexed\": 214, \"files_skipped\": 4}","tags":["phase5:case:codebase_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:authmiddleware::symbol","phase5:facet:run","phase5:tool:index_codebase_sh"],"hash":"33827ee322e034597fcd94e713db66d0ae0279ebe46d2d6e2263965d7e634e83"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4110-7163-9dd7-8a6c8c79285e","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Evidence kind: spot_check\nSupports claim: True\nSummary: Spot-check searches returned the expected API and database files after indexing\nMetric: files_indexed=214","tags":["phase5:case:codebase_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:authmiddleware::symbol","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"764aff3a14b1624334a4c8dceed66a05f6f6fdc7c8130365097430128c13a788"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4110-7163-9dd7-8a75f3b7f535","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: Batch ingest of Rust files produced useful code search coverage; Path-derived subsystem tags improved discovery","tags":["phase5:case:codebase_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:authmiddleware::symbol","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"29050861c6e6e57bc4f434d3d3b2aaaba28eb299a8fb14602649e7f18994cdc7"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-4111-72d0-a06f-5077b6c73ea8","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134313232,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What faile