ected route modules and billing components after indexing\nMetric: files_indexed=188","tags":["phase5:case:frontend_route_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:billingroutes::symbol","phase5:facet:evidence"],"hash":"c38cd4246ad61368d71ec27c7f50750f46060dd436b03f8b9916ff8a037ee763"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-5cf2-7cb0-9e05-125f2cf3472d","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134320370,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What worked: Batch ingest of frontend files produced useful route and component search coverage; Route-derived tags improved discovery for UI flows","tags":["phase5:case:frontend_route_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:billingroutes::symbol","phase5:facet:worked"],"hash":"4264e9a9ea712a4716a7c505e81502af26bac378ebafb7a61533697490cd9765"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-5cf2-7cb0-9e05-126bdf38d51c","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134320370,"chunk_type":"research","status":"final","source":{},"text":"What failed: A broad docs-plus-storybook batch was too noisy; Minified bundles added low-value retrieval candidates\nUncertainty: Route aliases and MDX docs still need better chunking","tags":["phase5:case:frontend_route_indexing","phase5:dataset:repository_snapshot::head","phase5:entity:billingroutes::symbol","phase5:facet:failed"],"hash":"ecb0f3708f7eddf77e6bddf7d4dbe6fed21a002e1a9dad283e691fa5c1934153"}{"chunk_id":"019d12a5-5cf2-7cb0-9e05-12738a1bc340","tenant_id":"phase5_chunk_baseline","project_id":"phase5_repo_indexing","timestamp_created":1774134320370,"chunk_type":"summary","status":"final","source":{},"text":"Validation: Searches for billing routes and shared UI helpers returned the expected files\nFollowups: Index UI docs separately with route tags; Add component ownership metadata\nConfidence: 0.79","tags":["phase5:case:frontend_route_indexing","phase5:data